### ============================================================================
### Menu Invisible Feature API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### API Prefix: /api/adm/menu/app
### ============================================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
#@baseUrl = http://129.204.59.156:30081
@apiPrefix = /api/adm/menu/app
@jwtToken = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
@menuId = 1

### ============================================================================
### Setup: Get all menus and extract IDs dynamically
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-Setup-01: Get all menu groups (existing endpoint - excludes invisible)

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/group
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

###
### TC-Setup-02: Get all menus including invisible and extract IDs

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

# @extract data.0.id -> parentMenuId
# @extract data.1.id -> childMenuId

### ============================================================================
### TC-01: Get All Menus Without Search
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-01-01: Get all menus including invisible - without search parameter

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### ============================================================================
### TC-02: Get All Menus With Search
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-02-01: Get all menus with search parameter

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus?search=menu
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

###
### TC-02-02: Get all menus with empty search

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus?search=
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### ============================================================================
### TC-03: Set Menu to Invisible (Default Behavior)
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-03-01: Set {{parentMenuId}} to invisible (no request body - defaults to value=1)

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{parentMenuId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### TC-03-02: Verify menu is now invisible

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

###
### TC-03-03: Verify menu is filtered from regular group endpoint

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/group
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### ============================================================================
### TC-04: Set Menu to Invisible (Explicit Value)
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-04-01: Set {{childMenuId}} to invisible with explicit value=1

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{childMenuId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 1
}

###
### TC-04-02: Verify child menu is now invisible

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### ============================================================================
### TC-05: Set Menu to Visible
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-05-01: Set {{parentMenuId}} back to visible (value=0)

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{parentMenuId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 0
}

###
### TC-05-02: Verify menu is visible again

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/group
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### ============================================================================
### TC-06: Toggle Menu Visibility Multiple Times
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-06-01: Toggle {{childMenuId}} to invisible

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{childMenuId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 1
}

###
### TC-06-02: Toggle {{childMenuId}} back to visible

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{childMenuId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 0
}

###
### TC-06-03: Toggle {{childMenuId}} to invisible again (default behavior)

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{childMenuId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
### TC-06-04: Final toggle - back to visible

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{childMenuId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 0
}

### ============================================================================
### TC-07: Invalid Menu ID
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-07-01: Attempt to set invisible on non-existent menu ID

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/999999/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 1
}

### ============================================================================
### TC-08: Invalid Invisible Value (Out of Range)
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-08-01: Try to set invisible to value=2 (invalid)
# @expected 400

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{parentMenuId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 2
}

###
### TC-08-02: Try to set invisible to value=-1 (invalid)
# @expected 400

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{parentMenuId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": -1
}

###
### TC-08-03: Try to set invisible to value=10 (invalid)
# @expected 400

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{parentMenuId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 10
}

### ============================================================================
### TC-09: Invalid Request Body Format
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-09-01: Send string value instead of integer
# @expected 400

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{parentMenuId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": "invalid"
}

### ============================================================================
### TC-10: Missing Authorization
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-10-01: Request without JWT token

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{parentMenuId}}/op/invisible
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 0
}

###
### TC-10-02: Request with invalid token

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{parentMenuId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_12345
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 0
}

### ============================================================================
### TC-11: Parent Menu Invisible - Children Affected
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-11-01: Get fresh menu data and extract test IDs

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

# @extract data.0.id -> testParentId
# @extract data.1.id -> testChildId

###
### TC-11-02: Set parent menu to invisible

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{testParentId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 1
}

###
### TC-11-03: Verify parent and children are filtered from regular group endpoint

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/group
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

###
### TC-11-04: Verify parent and children still appear in all menus endpoint

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

###
### TC-11-05: Restore parent menu visibility

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{testParentId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 0
}

### ============================================================================
### TC-12: Child Menu Independent Visibility
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-12-01: Set second menu to invisible (different from parent)

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{testChildId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 1
}

###
### TC-12-02: Verify first menu is still visible in group endpoint

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/group
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

###
### TC-12-03: Restore second menu visibility

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{testChildId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 0
}

### ============================================================================
### Comparison Tests: Group vs All Menus Endpoints
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-Compare-01: Regular group endpoint (excludes invisible menus)

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/group
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

###
### TC-Compare-02: All menus endpoint (includes invisible menus)

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### ============================================================================
### Cleanup: Restore All Menus to Visible State
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-Cleanup-01: Restore parent menu

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{parentMenuId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 0
}

###
### TC-Cleanup-02: Restore child menu

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{childMenuId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 0
}

###
### TC-Cleanup-03: Restore test parent menu

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{testParentId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 0
}

###
### TC-Cleanup-04: Restore test child menu

POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{testChildId}}/op/invisible
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 0
}

###
### TC-Cleanup-05: Final verification - all menus should be visible

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/group
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
